{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47013","headline":"风琴引 · 齐己","name":"风琴引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挼吴丝，雕楚竹，高托天风拂爲曲。\n一一宫商在素空，鸾鸣凤语翘梧桐。\n夜深天碧松风多，孤窗寒梦惊流波。\n愁魂傍枕不肯去，翻疑住处邻湘娥。\n金风声尽熏风发，冷泛虚堂韵难歇。\n常恐听多耳渐烦，清音不绝知音绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}